# Scout report: the **quiz** format in `data/c1/notes.md`

A long opening paragraph that runs well past the reader's width, so that it has to wrap onto more than one line when the pane is narrow,
and it carries on over a second source line that joins the same paragraph and ends with the words longer still.

## What we found

- First finding with **bold words** and `a code span`
- Second finding, see [the course page](https://example.org/course)
  1. A nested numbered step

